Subject: inputtino: map VK_VOLUME_* / VK_MEDIA_* (0xAD-0xB3) to evdev media keys

Sunshine v2026.516.143833 vendors inputtino f4ce2b0, whose VK->evdev table has no
entries for the Windows media virtual keys, so volume/mute/play keys sent by
Moonlight are dropped on the host. Apply in the Sunshine checkout root (-p1).

diff --git a/third-party/inputtino/src/uinput/include/inputtino/keyboard.hpp b/third-party/inputtino/src/uinput/include/inputtino/keyboard.hpp
index 35d1c3b..841e4a4 100644
--- a/third-party/inputtino/src/uinput/include/inputtino/keyboard.hpp
+++ b/third-party/inputtino/src/uinput/include/inputtino/keyboard.hpp
@@ -73,6 +73,11 @@ static const std::map<short, KEY_MAP> key_mappings = {
     {0xA0, {KEY_LEFTSHIFT, 0x700E1}},  {0xA1, {KEY_RIGHTSHIFT, 0x700E5}},
     {0xA2, {KEY_LEFTCTRL, 0x700E0}},   {0xA3, {KEY_RIGHTCTRL, 0x700E4}},
     {0xA4, {KEY_LEFTALT, 0x7002E}},    {0xA5, {KEY_RIGHTALT, 0x700E6}},
+    // VK_VOLUME_* / VK_MEDIA_* (HID consumer-page usages as scan codes)
+    {0xAD, {KEY_MUTE, 0xC00E2}},       {0xAE, {KEY_VOLUMEDOWN, 0xC00EA}},
+    {0xAF, {KEY_VOLUMEUP, 0xC00E9}},   {0xB0, {KEY_NEXTSONG, 0xC00B5}},
+    {0xB1, {KEY_PREVIOUSSONG, 0xC00B6}}, {0xB2, {KEY_STOPCD, 0xC00B7}},
+    {0xB3, {KEY_PLAYPAUSE, 0xC00CD}},
     {0xBA, {KEY_SEMICOLON, 0x70033}},  {0xBB, {KEY_EQUAL, 0x7002E}},
     {0xBC, {KEY_COMMA, 0x70036}},      {0xBD, {KEY_MINUS, 0x7002D}},
     {0xBE, {KEY_DOT, 0x70037}},        {0xBF, {KEY_SLASH, 0x70038}},
